findings.suggestion:
Update `resetState` to revoke the Blob URL and clear backup-codes state:
```tsx
const resetState = () => {
  setPassword("");
  setErrorMessage(null);
  setStep(SetupStep.ConfirmPassword);
  if (backupCodesUrl) URL.revokeObjectURL(backupCodesUrl);
  setBackupCodesUrl("");
  setBackupCodes([]);
};
```
Additionally, add a `useEffect` cleanup to revoke the URL on unmount as defense-in-depth.
